          <h1>About Me</h1>
          <p>What makes a &ldquo;good&rdquo; life? How do others see it, and what feels right for me? These questions have stayed with me for as long as I can remember. More followed:</p>
          <div class="um-questions">
            <span>How can I be in good contact with myself and with others?</span>
            <span>How can we really understand each other?</span>
            <span>What helps a relationship stay steady and feel good?</span>
            <span>What helps when life gets hard or a conflict arises?</span>
            <span>What helps us keep growing as people?</span>
          </div>
          <p>For me, these questions have always belonged as much to private life as to working life. What started as a personal interest has become the heart of my work. I’m moved and grateful to be able to support people when something shifts in their life, at work or at home, and they want to keep developing.</p><button class="rd-readmore" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="faq-toggle"></span><span class="rd-readmore-t">Read more</span></button>
